# Rig for War: "Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains reach and first strike until end of turn" (CR 611.2a), {1}{R} paid exactly.
# It can't target a noncreature permanent (Bot1's Mox Jet). Cast on Bot1's own Grizzly Bears (2/2 becomes 5/2 with reach and first
# strike, toughness untouched); the effect ends with the turn, so the Bears are plain on Bot2's turn. On turn 3 (Jet's black mana alone can't pay it, and Ruby's red alone can't pay the generic part)
# it targets the opponent's Ornithopter (0/2 flyer); the Bears, not targeted again, stay 2/2.

